$CATEGORY: Vocabulary/HansenQuinn/4/verb

::Q001::[markdown]Which form means “I have drawn up (in battle)”?:{
	~%-100%τέθαμμαι#Incorrect. **τέθαμμαι** is Principal Part 5 of **θάπτω** “I have been buried” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%τάξω#Incorrect. **τάξω** is Principal Part 2 of **τάττω** “I will draw up (in battle)” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%τέταγμαι#Incorrect. **τέταγμαι** is Principal Part 5 of **τάττω** “I have been drawn up (in battle)” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%τέθυκα#Incorrect. **τέθυκα** is Principal Part 4 of **θύω** “I have sacrificed” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%τάττω#Incorrect. **τάττω** is Principal Part 1 of **τάττω** “I draw up (in battle)” (Chapter 4).
	~%100%τέταχα#Correct: “I have drawn up (in battle)” is **τέταχα** ( 4th PP of **τάττω**, Chapter 4).
	~%-100%ἐτάχθην#Incorrect. **ἐτάχθην** is Principal Part 6 of **τάττω** “I was drawn up (in battle)” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%ἔταξα#Incorrect. **ἔταξα** is Principal Part 3 of **τάττω** “I drew up (in battle)” (Chapter 4).
}


::Q002::[markdown]Which form means “I have been willing”?:{
	~%-100%λέλυκα#Incorrect. **λέλυκα** is Principal Part 4 of **λύω** “I have unbound” (Chapter 2).
	~%-100%κέκληκα#Incorrect. **κέκληκα** is Principal Part 4 of **καλέω** “I have called” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%ἐθελήσω#Incorrect. **ἐθελήσω** is Principal Part 2 of **ἐθέλω** “I will be willing” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%βέβληκα#Incorrect. **βέβληκα** is Principal Part 4 of **βάλλω** “I have thrown” (Chapter 11).
	~%-100%ἠθέλησα#Incorrect. **ἠθέλησα** is Principal Part 3 of **ἐθέλω** “I was willing” (Chapter 4).
	~%100%ἠθέληκα#Correct: “I have been willing” is **ἠθέληκα** ( 4th PP of **ἐθέλω**, Chapter 4).
	~%-100%ἠδίκηκα#Incorrect. **ἠδίκηκα** is Principal Part 4 of **ἀδικέω** “I have done wrong” (Chapter 9).
	~%-100%ἐθέλω#Incorrect. **ἐθέλω** is Principal Part 1 of **ἐθέλω** “I am willing” (Chapter 4).
}


::Q003::[markdown]What does **ἐτάχθην** (the 6th Principal Part of τάττω) mean?:{
	~%-100%I will order#Incorrect. **τάξω** is Principal Part 2 of **τάττω** “I will order” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%I drew up (in battle)#Incorrect. **ἔταξα** is Principal Part 3 of **τάττω** “I drew up (in battle)” (Chapter 4).
	~%100%I was drawn up (in battle)#Correct: **ἐτάχθην** ( 6th PP of **τάττω** ) means “I was drawn up (in battle)” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%I have been arranged#Incorrect. **τέταγμαι** is Principal Part 5 of **τάττω** “I have been arranged” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%I arranged#Incorrect. **ἔταξα** is Principal Part 3 of **τάττω** “I arranged” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%I order#Incorrect. **τάττω** is Principal Part 1 of **τάττω** “I order” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%I arrange#Incorrect. **τάττω** is Principal Part 1 of **τάττω** “I arrange” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%I have drawn up (in battle)#Incorrect. **τέταχα** is Principal Part 4 of **τάττω** “I have drawn up (in battle)” (Chapter 4).
}


::Q004::[markdown]ἐθέλω:{
	~%-100%I will make (someone) stop#Incorrect. **παύσω** is Principal Part 2 of **παύω** “I will make (someone) stop” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%I wished#Incorrect. **ἠθέλησα** is Principal Part 3 of **ἐθέλω** “I wished” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%I will be present#Incorrect. **ἥξω** is Principal Part 2 of **ἥκω** “I will be present” (Chapter 8).
	~%-100%I lead#Incorrect. **ἄγω** is Principal Part 1 of **ἄγω** “I lead” (Chapter 8).
	~%-100%I have remained#Incorrect. **μεμένηκα** is Principal Part 4 of **μένω** “I have remained” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%I finished#Incorrect. **ἑτελεύτησα** is Principal Part 3 of **τελευτάω** “I finished” (Chapter 10).
	~%100%I wish#Correct: **ἐθέλω** is Principal Part 1 of **ἐθέλω** “I wish” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%I will unbind#Incorrect. **λύσω** is Principal Part 2 of **λύω** “I will unbind” (Chapter 2).
}


::Q005::[markdown]γέγραμμαι:{
	~%-100%I thought it right#Incorrect. **ἠξίωσα** is Principal Part 3 of **ἀξιόω** “I thought it right” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%I wrong#Incorrect. **ἀδικέω** is Principal Part 1 of **ἀδικέω** “I wrong” (Chapter 9).
	~%-100%I will guard#Incorrect. **φυλάξω** is Principal Part 2 of **φυλάττω** “I will guard” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%I command#Incorrect. **κελεύω** is Principal Part 1 of **κελεύω** “I command” (Chapter 2).
	~%-100%I will expect#Incorrect. **ἀξιώσω** is Principal Part 2 of **ἀξιόω** “I will expect” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%I wrote#Incorrect. **ἔγραψα** is Principal Part 3 of **γράφω** “I wrote” (Chapter 3).
	~%100%I have been drawn#Correct: **γέγραμμαι** is Principal Part 5 of **γράφω** “I have been drawn” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%I taught#Incorrect. **ἐπαίδευσα** is Principal Part 3 of **παιδεύω** “I taught” (Chapter 2).
}


