	~%-100%I was unbound#Incorrect. **ἔλύθην** is Principal Part 6 of **λύω** “I was unbound” (Chapter 2).
	~%-100%I will bury#Incorrect. **θάψω** is Principal Part 2 of **θάπτω** “I will bury” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%I have been buried#Incorrect. **τέθαμμαι** is Principal Part 5 of **θάπτω** “I have been buried” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%I conquer#Incorrect. **νικάω** is Principal Part 1 of **νικάω** “I conquer” (Chapter 9).
	~%100%I bury#Correct: **θάπτω** ( 1st PP of **θάπτω** ) means “I bury” (Chapter 4).
}


