	~%-100%ἐθέλω#Incorrect. **ἐθέλω** is Principal Part 1 of **ἐθέλω** “I am willing” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%ἠδίκηκα#Incorrect. **ἠδίκηκα** is Principal Part 4 of **ἀδικέω** “I have done wrong” (Chapter 9).
	~%-100%βέβληκα#Incorrect. **βέβληκα** is Principal Part 4 of **βάλλω** “I have thrown” (Chapter 11).
	~%-100%κέκληκα#Incorrect. **κέκληκα** is Principal Part 4 of **καλέω** “I have called” (Chapter 10).
}


::Q044::[markdown]What does **τέθαμμαι** (the 5th Principal Part of θάπτω) mean?:{
	~%-100%I was saved#Incorrect. **ἐσώθην** is Principal Part 6 of **σῴζω** “I was saved” (Chapter 7).
	~%-100%I was buried#Incorrect. **ἐτάφην** is Principal Part 6 of **θάπτω** “I was buried” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%I will bury#Incorrect. **θάψω** is Principal Part 2 of **θάπτω** “I will bury” (Chapter 4).
	~%100%I have been buried#Correct: **τέθαμμαι** ( 5th PP of **θάπτω** ) means “I have been buried” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%I buried#Incorrect. **ἔθαψα** is Principal Part 3 of **θάπτω** “I buried” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%I bury#Incorrect. **θάπτω** is Principal Part 1 of **θάπτω** “I bury” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%I honored#Incorrect. **ἐτίμησα** is Principal Part 3 of **τιμάω** “I honored” (Chapter 9).
	~%-100%I will guard#Incorrect. **φυλάξω** is Principal Part 2 of **φυλάττω** “I will guard” (Chapter 3).
}


